    docs(vcs): document the uncomputable failure shape in the contract (#606)
    
    Updates the prStatusRollup row: the failure arm is now the frozen
    {uncomputable, reason, detail} shape built by the single
    vcs/lib/uncomputable-cause.mjs constructor, never bare null. reason is
    advisory; detail carries the provider's own words on every path, matched
    or not. [] stays reserved for a successfully-fetched, genuinely empty
    rollup. States this is the declared destination for the 13 remaining
    cause-discarding sites filed as a follow-up.

